{"id":"h-0392","domain":"yin yang swap","names":["Yin","Yang"],"text":"Turn the red diamond into a circle, and turn the blue circle into a diamond. Then move Yang below Yin. Which shape is the leftmost? My notes from the meeting are a bit scattered.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"mention(color=red,shape=diamond)","shape":"circle"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"mention(color=blue,shape=circle)","shape":"diamond"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Yang","position":"below","anchor":"Yin"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"leftmost"}}]}
{"id":"h-0393","domain":"tree planting map","names":["Oak2","Elm2","Birch"],"text":"Which green shape is closest to Birch? Also move Elm2 to the top right corner. Is Oak2 smaller than Elm2? I really appreciate you taking a look.","wires":[{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"nearest","anchor":"Birch","superlative":"closest","color":"green"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Elm2","position":"topRight"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"check","target":"Oak2","comparison":"smaller","anchor":"Elm2"}}]}
{"id":"h-0394","domain":"three node network","names":["P1","P2","P3"],"text":"Connect P1 to P2 with a plain line, and P2 to P3 with a dotted line. Which shape is least connected? And is P1 reachable from P3? Sorry for the messy notes.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"P1","to":"P2","arrow":"none"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"P2","to":"P3","style":"dotted"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"leastConnected"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"path","from":"P3","to":"P1"}}]}
{"id":"h-0395","domain":"board recovery","names":["Chip2","Board2"],"text":"Oops I deleted something, redo it please. Also count how many shapes are on the board, and tell me the color of Chip2. My partner says the first draft was confusing. Honestly this has been a long week.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"redo"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"count"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"property","target":"Chip2","property":"color"}}]}
{"id":"h-0396","domain":"layer fix for background","names":["Bg","Fg"],"text":"Send the background shape to the back, which is the gray rectangle. Then move Fg above Bg. Which shape is topmost? Fingers crossed it all fits on one page.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"toBack","target":"mention(color=gray,shape=rectangle)"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Fg","position":"above","anchor":"Bg"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"topmost"}}]}
{"id":"h-0397","domain":"lantern post sketch","names":["Lantern","Post"],"text":"Nudge Post 30 pixels down so it lines up with Lantern. Make Lantern a tiny yellow star, and connect Post to Lantern with a plain arrow. Is there any square on the map? I would rather get it right than fast.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Post","direction":"down","distance":"30"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Lantern","size":"tiny"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Lantern","color":"yellow"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Lantern","shape":"star"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"connect","from":"Post","to":"Lantern"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"exists","shape":"square"}}]}
{"id":"h-0398","domain":"seed pot duplication","names":["Seed2","Pot2"],"text":"Duplicate Seed2 four times, one per pot. Make Pot2 a small brown rectangle. Which shapes are brown? Also who is directly linked to Seed2?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"duplicate","target":"Seed2","count":"4"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Pot2","size":"small"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Pot2","color":"brown"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Pot2","shape":"rectangle"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"list","color":"brown"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"neighbors","target":"Seed2"}}]}
{"id":"h-0399","domain":"column spacing","names":["Col1","Col2","Col3"],"text":"Distribute all the columns horizontally so the spacing is even. Which column is the leftmost? And is Col2 bigger than Col3? Appreciate the quick turnaround on everything.","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"distribute","target":"mention(quantifier=all,shape=rectangle)","axis":"horizontal"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"leftmost"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"check","target":"Col2","comparison":"bigger","anchor":"Col3"}}]}
{"id":"h-0400","domain":"grid screen fit","names":["Tiles2","Grid5","Frame5"],"text":"Arrange everything in a grid so it fits on one screen. Make Frame5 a large navy oval and move Tiles2 below Grid5. How many shapes are navy? Which shape is the rightmost?","wires":[{"type":"command","args":{"action":"arrange","layout":"grid"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Frame5","size":"large"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Frame5","color":"navy"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"set","target":"Frame5","shape":"ellipse"}},{"type":"command","args":{"action":"move","target":"Tiles2","position":"below","anchor":"Grid5"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"count","color":"navy"}},{"type":"question","args":{"ask":"extreme","superlative":"rightmost"}}]}
